122
00:04:12,923 --> 00:04:15,007
That was described in a twenty thirteen

123
00:04:15,007 --> 00:04:17,090
bulletin from the Consumer Financial

124
00:04:17,090 --> 00:04:18,208
Protection Bureau,

125
00:04:18,208 --> 00:04:20,513
which Congress later overturned.

126
00:04:20,663 --> 00:04:23,173
The Bureau's own advice is simple.

127
00:04:23,283 --> 00:04:25,596
Rates through dealers are often higher,

128
00:04:25,596 --> 00:04:28,529
