136
00:04:41,443 --> 00:04:44,091
So you pay interest on them too,

137
00:04:44,091 --> 00:04:45,226
for years.

138
00:04:45,483 --> 00:04:46,757
Add it up,

139
00:04:46,757 --> 00:04:49,696
and the finance office is a gold

140
00:04:49,696 --> 00:04:50,623
mine.

141
00:04:50,813 --> 00:04:52,260
At AutoNation,

142
00:04:52,260 --> 00:04:54,713
