145
00:04:58,589 --> 00:05:00,797
one point four six billion dollars in

146
00:05:00,797 --> 00:05:02,623
twenty twenty-five.

147
00:05:02,843 --> 00:05:04,593
By our calculation,

148
00:05:04,593 --> 00:05:06,369
that is more than twice the gross

149
00:05:06,369 --> 00:05:08,999
profit it made selling new cars.

150
00:05:09,250 --> 00:05:11,720
Regulators tried to step in.

151
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:14,179
In December twenty twenty-three,

152
00:05:14,179 --> 00:05:17,013
