159
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:30,392
It expected to save consumers more than

160
00:05:30,392 --> 00:05:32,940
three point four billion dollars a year.

161
00:05:33,260 --> 00:05:35,420
The dealers' association sued.

162
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:37,525
In January twenty twenty-five,

163
00:05:37,525 --> 00:05:40,889
