164
00:05:41,150 --> 00:05:43,270
Let me draw the loan.

165
00:05:43,330 --> 00:05:45,460
Here is the price of the car.

166
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,706
Add the add-ons,

167
00:05:46,706 --> 00:05:48,710
rolled into the loan.

168
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:51,240
Add a slightly higher interest rate.

169
