00:07:05,993 --> 00:07:08,583
People can delay buying a new car.

201
00:07:08,613 --> 00:07:11,483
They cannot delay fixing the brakes.

202
00:07:11,753 --> 00:07:15,283
Warranty repairs are paid by the carmaker,

203
00:07:15,283 --> 00:07:17,472
