227
00:08:02,420 --> 00:08:03,540
Michigan's law,

228
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:04,660
for example,

229
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:07,174
says a manufacturer may not sell a

230
00:08:07,174 --> 00:08:09,916
