250
00:08:55,283 --> 00:08:57,343
Let me draw the wall.

251
00:08:57,403 --> 00:08:59,073
Here is the carmaker.

252
00:08:59,073 --> 00:09:00,363
Here is you.

253
00:09:00,443 --> 00:09:01,393
Between you,

254
00:09:01,393 --> 00:09:03,073
