256
00:09:04,443 --> 00:09:06,096
The dealer stands in that door,

257
00:09:06,096 --> 00:09:07,539
and every sale,

258
00:09:07,539 --> 00:09:10,259
every loan and every repair passes through

259
00:09:10,259 --> 00:09:11,068
it.

260
00:09:11,317 --> 00:09:13,311
And on the other side of that

261
00:09:13,311 --> 00:09:13,784
door,

262
00:09:13,784 --> 00:09:15,879
the bill lands on the buyer.

263
