290
00:10:22,282 --> 00:10:23,786
annual basis.

291
00:10:24,050 --> 00:10:26,800
Let me put the dealership together.

292
00:10:26,860 --> 00:10:28,900
A thin profit on the car.

293
00:10:28,900 --> 00:10:30,864
A thick profit on the loan and

294
00:10:30,864 --> 00:10:32,200
the add-ons.

295
00:10:32,250 --> 00:10:34,992
A steady profit on every repair for

296
00:10:34,992 --> 00:10:35,820
years.

297
00:10:35,950 --> 00:10:37,729
And a law that keeps the door

298
00:10:37,729 --> 00:10:39,570
in the dealer's hands.

299
00:10:39,570 --> 00:10:41,340
The car is the bait.

300
00:10:41,350 --> 00:10:44,138
The customer is the business.

301
00:10:44,383 --> 00:10:46,966
So how do car dealerships really make

302
00:10:46,966 --> 00:10:48,083
money?

303
00:10:48,203 --> 00:10:49,825
Not mainly on the car you drive

304
00:10:49,825 --> 00:10:51,033
away in.

305
00:10:51,033 --> 00:10:52,622
On the loan you sign for it,

306
00:10:52,622 --> 00:10:54,413
the warranty you add to it,

307
00:10:54,413 --> 00:10:56,823
and the service bay you return to.

308
00:10:57,023 --> 00:10:59,133
Knowing that changes how you buy.

309
00:10:59,133 --> 00:11:00,548
Negotiate the price,

310
00:11:00,548 --> 00:11:01,964
but also the rate,

311
00:11:01,964 --> 00:11:04,003
the add-ons and the term.

312
00:11:04,003 --> 00:11:06,492
That is where the dealer's money really

313
00:11:06,492 --> 00:11:07,341
is.

314
00:11:07,583 --> 00:11:10,241
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

315
00:11:10,241 --> 00:11:13,412
we follow the money behind another hidden

316
00:11:13,412 --> 00:11:15,963
link of the world economy.

317
00:11:16,063 --> 00:11:18,546
This is The Hidden Economics.
